# scaleup_single_switch_2_12800Gbps.topo
# 2-host NVLink-class scale-up domain: one non-blocking crossbar (Podsize==Nodes==
# Radix_Down => 1 ToR, one hop). Per-host 12800 Gbps = the MAX of the
# intranode-linkspeed sweep, so the swept -intranode_linkspeed governs under the
# fabric ceiling at every point (see AA-plan-Intranode-Linkspeed-Sweep §7).
# Degenerate 2-tier encoding because the FatTree parser rejects Tiers=1.
Nodes 2
Tiers 2
Podsize 2

Tier 0
Downlink_speed_Gbps 12800
Radix_Down 2
Radix_Up 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 500
Switch_Latency_ns 300
Oversubscribed 2

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 12800
Radix_Down 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 500
Switch_Latency_ns 300
